WEBVTT

00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:30.101
that mommy and daddy

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:32.750
were not going to be living
in the same house anymore.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.875
Our breakup hit me really hard.

00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:42.018
But I decided

00:01:42.042 --> 00:01:46.792
I wouldn't let my broken heart
get in the way of what was best for Sekou.

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:50.476
We struggled initially,
trying to navigate this new space

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.750
as co-parents.

00:01:53.542 --> 00:01:55.476
I asked myself,

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.351
how do we raise this beautiful boy
full of wonder and promise